            <div class="prose max-w-none text-text-base dark:text-text-dark space-y-4">
              <p>
                I architect the data systems and operational workflows that make complex organizations transparent and manageable. Over more than a decade at <strong>Bombardier Aviation</strong>, <strong>Triumph Group</strong>, and across the aerospace, heavy manufacturing, and energy sectors, I have engineered high-throughput ETL data pipelines, deployed 150+ Power BI and Power Apps solutions, and built full-stack production-tracking applications connecting factory mechanics to executive steering committees.
              </p>
              <p>
